<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="d1f91e65">&lt;ul class=&quot;noindent&quot;&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Conduct peer review sessions to walk through early course development in order to ensure consistency across the
        development team.
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Review and assess training material against original training design.
    &lt;/li&gt;
